    "Select unresolved decisions that intersect selected nodes, claims, surfaces, tools, external effects, release, or completion.",
    "Sort selected stable IDs bytewise, reject missing references and conflicts, and record the exact selected-ID set with the context ID.",
    "Revalidate selected rows against the same live session before using them for a claim or root decision."
  ],
